<title>USA: FGIC qualifies five issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies five issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co on Thursday said that it qualified for bond insurance the following five municipal bond issues, which are scheduled to be sold competitively:</p>
<p>--Pittsburg Unified School District, Calif., $5 million general obligations.</p>
<p>--Illinois, $250 million GOs.</p>
<p>--St Peters, Mo., $7.2 nillion GO refunding bonds, direct purchase.</p>
<p>--Hempsted Town, N.Y , $81.677 million various purpose.</p>
<p>--Lexington County Recreation District, S.C., $7.3 million GO refunding bonds.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650)).</p>
</text>
